content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Person or organization requesting workflow automation"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review Request",
      "description": "Initial request to examine tasks and processes for automation potential",
      "attributes": [
        "Task",
        "Process Documentation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Task",
      "description": "Individual activity within the client’s workflow"
    },
    {
      "name": "Process Documentation",
      "description": "Material describing how the client’s current workflow operates"
    },
    {
      "name": "Automation Consultant",
      "description": "Specialist who analyzes workflows and designs automation"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workflow Analysis",
      "description": "Evaluation of client workflows to identify automation opportunities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workflow Automation Plan",
      "description": "Proposed setup for automating parts of the workflow",
      "attributes": [
        "Automation Script"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Automation Script",
      "description": "Executable automation logic that performs tasks automatically"
    },
    {
      "name": "System Administrator",
      "description": "Person managing system permissions and operational stability"
    },
    {
      "name": "Software Permission",
      "description": "Access settings required for automation scripts to run"
    },
    {
      "name": "Workflow Supervision",
      "description": "Oversight activity ensuring automated workflows run smoothly"
    },
    {
      "name": "Performance Report",
      "description": "Summary of automation results and efficiency gains"
    },
    {
      "name": "Automation Feedback",
      "description": "Client input about improvements or issues with the automation"
    }
  ]
}
```
```json
{
  "subdomains": {
    "Automation Design": {
      "objects": [
        "Automation Consultant",
        "Workflow Analysis",
        "Workflow Automation Plan",
        "Automation Script",
        "Performance Report"
      ]
    },
    "Client Requests": {
      "objects": [
        "Client",
        "Review Request",
        "Task",
        "Process Documentation",
        "Automation Feedback"
      ]
    },
    "Administration": {
      "objects": [
        "System Administrator",
        "Software Permission",
        "Workflow Supervision"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- In case an object appears in multiple bounded contexts, suggest a name change.
- Also suggest a name change if the meaning of the object is too similar to an object from another bounded context
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Automation Design": {
      "derived from": "Automation Design Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Automation Consultant",
        "Workflow Analysis",
        "Workflow Automation Plan",
        "Automation Script",
        "Performance Report"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Client Requests": {
      "derived from": "Client Requests Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Client",
        "Review Request",
        "Task",
        "Process Documentation",
        "Automation Feedback"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Administration": {
      "derived from": "Administration Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "System Administrator",
        "Software Permission",
        "Workflow Supervision"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    }
  }
}
```
